{
	"character": "Malphas",
	"voice": "am_onyx",
	"speed": 0.88,
	"lines": {
		"There you are, little witch. You took your time. Come into the light, where I can see how tired you are.": "malphas-6fbc2159e9.mp3",
		"Aren't you tired of holding it all up by yourself? Put it down. Let me carry it.": "malphas-7935b40033.mp3",
		"Sleep, Elena. Real sleep. You haven't had it since you left me.": "malphas-5a4b8bba1e.mp3",
		"One word and the running stops. Just one. You remember the word.": "malphas-81068ac613.mp3",
		"Feel how heavy your arms are. That isn't weakness. That's honesty.": "malphas-329040c685.mp3",
		"I have been patient. Rest is still on offer. For now.": "malphas-133974629a.mp3",
		"Every night you refuse me, the bed gets colder. You've noticed.": "malphas-aec50b6982.mp3",
		"Even burnt out, you shine. Do you know how rare that is?": "malphas-35d51788fa.mp3",
		"Grey suits you. Silver would suit you better. Come home and I'll show you.": "malphas-65ad08f9da.mp3",
		"They'll never see you, these mortals. They see a woman with a red pen. I see the storm.": "malphas-83cfa997e0.mp3",
		"Flattery is wasted on you tonight. Pity. You used to blush.": "malphas-197cda3415.mp3",
		"You traded storms for spreadsheets. For a man who corrects commas.": "malphas-820f07cffb.mp3",
		"You were my second. You could make the rain stop. Now you make tea.": "malphas-9e6c90e6e0.mp3",
		"Do you still feel it, under your skin? The place where the power was? It aches, doesn't it.": "malphas-d020628199.mp3",
		"You were magnificent. Now look at you. Choosing to be small.": "malphas-03c9dc47ed.mp3",
		"Enough. Come here.": "malphas-7aacf27bf5.mp3",
		"Say yes, Elena. You've been saying it in your sleep for weeks.": "malphas-53142e04d1.mp3",
		"Give me your hand.": "malphas-06c4de6100.mp3",
		"Kneel.": "malphas-f685d5ead2.mp3",
		"I will not ask a third time.": "malphas-fb47294d15.mp3",
		"Then wake, and be cold, and alone. I'll be here when you're tired again.": "malphas-3adaf967bc.mp3",
		"Samhain is coming, little witch. The veil thins. So does your resolve.": "malphas-e14a6a4319.mp3",
		"Run, then. You always come back when you're tired.": "malphas-452d7e4e7d.mp3",
		"Go. Wake up cold. I'll keep your side of the bed warm.": "malphas-79cb122be8.mp3",
		"Good. Good girl. Now rest.": "malphas-f29c890cd3.mp3",
		"There. Was that so hard? Come home.": "malphas-374a0319f9.mp3",
		"Then rest. Let the silk hold you. You were always coming home.": "malphas-82b11f2866.mp3"
	}
}
